{"title":"2023 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CoolMathProblems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CoolMathProblems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#*Simple_Video_Explanation_by_MathTalks_Now*\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">*Simple Video Explanation by MathTalks_Now*</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(How_to_Creatively_THINK!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (How to Creatively THINK!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Smart_and_Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Magic Square</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_harungurcan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by harungurcan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution!_Super_Easy_Explanation_and_Insanely_Fast!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution! Super Easy Explanation and Insanely Fast!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Wind chill</i> is a measure of how cold people feel when exposed to wind outside. A good estimate for wind chill can be found using this calculation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/8/66810c2843261301faabc4441239f8fa51b1f231.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\text{wind chill}) = (\\text{air temperature}) - 0.7 \\times (\\text{wind speed}),\\]\" width=\"402\" height=\"18\" />\nwhere temperature is measured in degrees Fahrenheit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/8/50825c320108cf386419b90d13b40038bb67b5fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(^{\\circ}\\text{F})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"34\" height=\"20\" /> and the wind speed is measured in miles per hour (mph). Suppose the air temperature is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98e5583028cdbf68ab0b262d5808fb705b30a15d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36^{\\circ}\\text{F}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"15\" /> and the wind speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> mph. Which of the following is closest to the approximate wind chill?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab27a378df7ae3d311c15288f4fbcf3267b0fbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 23 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 28 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 32 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By substitution, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9e7e2bf444a366a4862edaaf56aa6db8c2f779.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (\\text{wind chill}) &amp;= 36 - 0.7 \\times 18 \\\\ &amp;= 36 - 12.6 \\\\ &amp;= 23.4 \\\\ &amp;\\approx \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 23}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"211\" height=\"104\" />\n~apex304, SohumUttamchandani, wuwang2002, TaeKim, Cxrupptedpat, MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a3588bb395f693f5fd014687a9b680837fd2dc6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> is very close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> - therefore, we can substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> into the equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbe7bc7798f5bdecdaba67ffe4ff255cbb56c71f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[36 - \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot 18 = 36 - 12 = 24.\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"37\" /> As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> is slightly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a3588bb395f693f5fd014687a9b680837fd2dc6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />, the correct answer is slightly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdbe38ae96cfecd01248c5a34519c2c2932ea79f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~TheGoldenRetriever\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>0.7 is equivalent to 7/10. 7/10 times 18 is 126/10, which is 12.6. Since the air temperature is 36 degrees Fahrenheit, 36 - 12.6 is 23.4, which is the closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdbe38ae96cfecd01248c5a34519c2c2932ea79f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~AliceDubbleYou\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_CoolMathProblems\">Video Solution by CoolMathProblems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by CoolMathProblems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Pf93RGtKo1I?feature=shared&amp;t=109\">https://youtu.be/Pf93RGtKo1I?feature=shared&amp;t=109</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=113\">https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=113</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".2ASimple_Video_Explanation_by_MathTalks_Now.2A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"*Simple_Video_Explanation_by_MathTalks_Now*\">*Simple Video Explanation by MathTalks_Now*</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: *Simple Video Explanation by MathTalks_Now*\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://studio.youtube.com/video/PMOeiGLkDH0/edit\">https://studio.youtube.com/video/PMOeiGLkDH0/edit</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28How_to_Creatively_THINK.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(How_to_Creatively_THINK!!!)\">Video Solution (How to Creatively THINK!!!)</spa